  "prefLabel": "En 1007.09 Operation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1007.09 Operation. The utility shall provide PTO and the facility may begin operating provided that:\n\n(a) The applicant has received conditional approval to interconnect;\n\n(b) The utility has received proof of the respective electric code official’s approval including a signed certificate of completion or other inspector-code official provided documentation;\n\n(c) The applicant successfully completed the witness test if required by the utility pursuant to En 1011.11; and\n\n(d) The applicant has received written notice that the facility passed any review required by the utility or received notice that no review is required.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
